kiniksa-knsa-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KNSA 2026 Q1","e":"knsa","d":"2026-04-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Ross Moat","x":"…and machine learning models informed by de-identified claims, demographics, and consumer market data to define an enriched population of potential recurrent pericarditis patients to deliver tailored content, opposed to a traditional DTC approach of broad-scale and high-cost marketing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/kiniksa-knsa-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KNSA 2026 Q3","e":"knsa","d":"2026-10-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ross Moat","x":"On the patient side, we've seen encouraging early indicators from our Heart's Home direct-to-consumer campaign.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/27/kiniksa-knsa-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KNSA 2026 Q3","e":"knsa","d":"2026-10-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Ross Moat","x":"As a reminder, Heart's Home is a highly targeted DTC campaign where we've innovated from traditional DTC by using AI to produce and deliver a campaign that's effective for a rare disease audience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/27/kiniksa-knsa-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KNSA 2026 Q3","e":"knsa","d":"2026-10-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Ross Moat","x":"As this disease has a very high annual incident rate of patients coming into the labeled indication, this DTC initiative is nicely supplementing our robust execution in the field and helps us to address the substantial opportunity that we have ahead to help many more patients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/27/kiniksa-knsa-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[63,1,5426,0,0,0,4144,1018],[64,1,4569,0,0,0,1730,2243],[65,1,5711,0,0,0,4766,574],[67,1,4623,0,0,0,2492,1797]],"cinema":[[63,1,5426,0,0,0,4144,1018],[64,1,4569,0,0,0,1730,2243],[65,1,5711,0,0,0,4766,574],[67,1,4623